PH. The steel mesh pen was destroyed from the impact. My canopy carry bag ripped and I thought my Impact was too. Well, I got home and opened up my Impact with no problems…I just wanted to let you know you make one tough product.<br></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-5fd66dae"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-ec6ea607">CUSTOMER</span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-6dae5621"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-1c1ba52b">PR Marketing Manager<br></span></h4></div></div></div><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-cc474ed9" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-oUbqx bgMQOP pf-c174148c"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-e37373ef"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-fd7031b1">I wish to thank you and your staff at Impact Canopy for the excellent service and support we have received. The light weight of the canopies and the ease in which set-ups and tear downs are completed are drawing raves from our volunteers.<br></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-73ef8e97"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-948a372f">JONATHAN PON<br></span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-8e976baf"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-c00cf385">Supervisor, Community Services<br></span></h4></div></div></div><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-954f18af" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-oUbqx bgMQOP pf-379ccc47"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-56214b51"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-d7caf17f">Your patience and hard work helped ensure that the tents were situated appropriately given the many parameters encountered. We look forward to working with you to meet our tent requirements at upcoming events.<br>&nbsp;the many parameters encountered. We look forward to working with you to meet our tent requirements at upcoming events.<br>epellendus iure, dolor, tenetur suscipit laboriosam at quisquam explicabo natus! Minus placeat, deleniti ipsum.</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-4b51dd30"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-60e8a5e5">Nancy Green</span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-dd30c174"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-0de9e373">National Marine Manufacturers Association<br></span></h4></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-qPjXN eYzxUD pf-dc3b3577 pf-r pf-r-eh" data-pf-type="Row" style="--pf-s-lg:15px; --pf-s-md:15px; --pf-s-sm:15px; --pf-s-xs:15px;"><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-f5f9dc3b" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-oUbqx bgMQOP pf-c114b667"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-896e4314"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-1406b9fe">Nearly two years have passed since we purchased four Impact canopies, and we would like to tell you how completely satisfied we have been with this purchase. Their lightweight construction make these canopies simple to set up, yet they are also resilient enough to survive being shipped on an ongoing basis between our 230 stores. On the rare occasion that parts are required, we know that we can depend on Randy to ensure a level of customer service that is highly efficient and pleasant. Thank you, Impact, for setting the bar high when it comes to providing your customers with superior products and service.<br></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-43145b87"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-a8d9d08b">Andrea Meek<br></span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-5b87ff1a"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-d610e632">Advertising Planning Assistant<br></span></h4></div></div></div><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-b6679cad" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-oUbqx bgMQOP pf-ff1a7b86"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-e63297dd"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-29c3c085">It is and has been Mike’s approach to service and complete satisfaction that has made me a repeat customer and will continue to be for many years. I always prefer to do business with companies that offer excellent customer service, and that has always been the case when dealing with Mike and all his staff at Impact Canopy.<br></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-97dd79e7"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-459e9bc8">David Grandy<br></span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-79e78900"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-de8fdbd0">President<br></span></h4></div></div></div><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-9cadf5f9" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-type="Block" class="sc-oUbqx bgMQOP pf-7b86c114"><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-8900bcec"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-89c41134">To say the least, right from the start, Mike himself and the staff at Impact were professional, courteous and delivered what was promised, when it was promised. Pretty refreshing, really! The quality of the Impact tents is quite a bit better than what we were getting before and the speed in delivery and personal service that we get from these guys is excellent. Mike makes a point to check up on us, keeping us up to date on outstanding orders, taking care of small spare parts request and generally being a top notch supplier…something not always found these days.<br></span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-bcec2c68"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-2cf8a89b">PETER STACE-SMITH<br></span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-2c68896e"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-a19a5c6c">PR Marketing Manager<br></span></h4></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
